cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite both the software itself and the
  accompanying paper.
title: >-
  Unfitted HHO for elastodynamics with an imperfect interface: verification and
  reproduction code
abstract: >-
  Python implementation of the unfitted hybrid high-order (HHO) method for the
  elastic wave equation across a linear slip interface, together with the
  drivers that reproduce every table and figure of the accompanying paper.
type: software
version: 1.0.0
license: MIT
