      London WC1E 6BT, United Kingdom
    email: e.burman@ucl.ac.uk
keywords:
  - hybrid high-order methods
  - unfitted finite elements
  - cell agglomeration
  - elastodynamics
  - imperfect interface
  - linear slip interface
references:
